      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "In the mid‑1500s, the Lima Cabildo granted lands in the Chillón Valley to Nicolás de Ribera and to Francisco de Ampuero in Chuquitanta.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3,
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
